WEBVTT

00:00:01.820 --> 00:00:05.000
WRITTEN BY HYUGA NATSU

00:00:08.600 --> 00:00:15.500
THE APOTHECARY DARIES

00:01:29.280 --> 00:01:30.970
THE APOTHECARY DARIES

00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:35.020
‎This story is a work of fiction. The names of all of the characters, organizations, and so on
are imaginary. It also bears no connection to any specific real-life events.

00:01:37.350 --> 00:01:39.180
Sounds like insects chirping.

00:01:40.480 --> 00:01:42.810
Maomao, you should wear the fox mask too,

00:01:40.600 --> 00:01:44.630
Episode 43: The Festival

00:01:42.890 --> 00:01:44.650
the one you painted earlier.

00:01:50.190 --> 00:01:53.240
Red is usually used to line the eyes,

00:01:53.320 --> 00:01:55.820
but green? That's an odd choice.

00:01:56.830 --> 00:01:58.410
Kind of looks like a tanuki.

00:01:58.490 --> 00:02:01.830
What?
You look like a cat yourself, Maomao.

00:02:04.330 --> 00:02:05.920
My hair's getting in the way.

00:02:07.710 --> 00:02:09.130
I'll re-tie it for you.

00:02:10.050 --> 00:02:10.960
Sit down.

00:02:16.220 --> 00:02:18.390
It looks a bit plain...

00:02:18.470 --> 00:02:20.640
with just the ribbon.

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:22.180
I do not really mind.

00:02:22.270 --> 00:02:24.350
Then I'll lend you my hairpin,

00:02:24.440 --> 00:02:27.650
the spiderweb one! It's super cute.

00:02:28.860 --> 00:02:32.360
I actually have one. Can you use this?

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:36.660
Ooh. That's a nice one, Maomao.

00:02:36.740 --> 00:02:39.080
It was a gift.

00:02:39.160 --> 00:02:40.120
Hey,

00:02:41.370 --> 00:02:43.500
if I asked you to give it to me,
would you?

00:02:48.250 --> 00:02:50.840
- No.
- Boo...

00:02:51.630 --> 00:02:53.460
If I kept quiet, it would be fine,

00:02:53.550 --> 00:02:57.590
but Lord Jinshi is oddly good
at reading expressions.

00:02:58.510 --> 00:03:01.310
Well, before worrying about that,

00:03:01.390 --> 00:03:04.560
I do not even know
if I will get back to the capital.

00:03:07.310 --> 00:03:09.860
- All done!
- Thanks.

00:03:10.520 --> 00:03:13.400
The festival's at the shrine
outside the village.

00:03:14.110 --> 00:03:15.900
Come on, let's go!

00:03:32.250 --> 00:03:33.760
Maybe it is the torchlight,

00:03:34.340 --> 00:03:36.930
but they really do look like
a pack of foxes...

00:03:41.390 --> 00:03:43.220
It feels like a whole different world,
doesn't it?

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:44.140
Yeah.

00:03:44.720 --> 00:03:47.480
- Kind of weird, right?
- I suppose.

00:03:47.560 --> 00:03:51.190
Though the one next to me
looks more like a green tanuki.

00:03:52.020 --> 00:03:56.900
Sometimes I see others with green paint
around their eyes like Shisui.

00:03:56.990 --> 00:04:00.160
Mostly men.
I wonder if it means something.

00:04:03.620 --> 00:04:06.160
Seems like there are lots of locusts
this year.

00:04:06.250 --> 00:04:10.250
That is why they say this year's festival
has to be especially grand.

00:04:11.750 --> 00:04:14.170
So it is to ward off misfortune.

00:04:18.380 --> 00:04:20.430
Ground cherries do not taste good.

00:04:20.930 --> 00:04:22.220
I know.

00:04:22.300 --> 00:04:24.890
They are poisonous,
and in the pleasure district, courtesans...

00:04:24.970 --> 00:04:26.520
I know.

00:04:28.940 --> 00:04:31.310
- Disgusting.
- Sorry!

00:04:34.730 --> 00:04:37.070
When you go up here, there is the shrine.

00:04:37.570 --> 00:04:41.530
Did you know why the god worshipped here
is a fox

00:04:41.610 --> 00:04:43.780
and called the god of abundance?

00:04:44.370 --> 00:04:45.410
No.

00:04:45.490 --> 00:04:50.000
A long time ago,
a certain people lived in this region.

00:04:52.130 --> 00:04:55.420
Then, a different group
came from the west.

00:04:56.750 --> 00:05:00.430
Most villages drove them away,

00:05:00.510 --> 00:05:03.140
but a few accepted them.

00:05:04.470 --> 00:05:08.180
The people from the west had knowledge.

00:05:08.270 --> 00:05:12.690
How to enrich the soil,
how to deal with pests.

00:05:13.230 --> 00:05:16.320
There were people in the villages
who recognized that value.

00:05:17.610 --> 00:05:18.820
But then

00:05:18.900 --> 00:05:22.820
others came to steal
the newly fertile land.

00:05:23.990 --> 00:05:25.990
It kept happening,

00:05:26.080 --> 00:05:29.200
so they eventually built
hidden settlements deep in the forest—

00:05:30.830 --> 00:05:33.370
to live quietly, in secret.

00:05:40.380 --> 00:05:42.550
And the fox god?

00:05:43.130 --> 00:05:46.300
The foxes refer to the westerners
who brought that knowledge,

00:05:46.390 --> 00:05:48.140
they were also
the ancestors of this village.

00:05:49.060 --> 00:05:51.730
The foxes here are said to be white foxes.

00:05:51.810 --> 00:05:53.600
The masks were originally white too, right?

00:05:54.520 --> 00:05:56.060
Adding color means

00:05:56.150 --> 00:05:59.400
settling down
and blending in with the land.

00:06:02.820 --> 00:06:07.200
The white fox likely symbolizes pale skin.

00:06:07.740 --> 00:06:10.620
Over time, it blends as bloodlines mix...

00:06:11.200 --> 00:06:12.210
Wait.

00:06:13.250 --> 00:06:16.210
I feel like I have heard this
somewhere before.

00:06:16.290 --> 00:06:18.630
The men in this village,

00:06:18.710 --> 00:06:21.380
many of them cannot tell colors apart.

00:06:22.170 --> 00:06:24.470
It happens with some women too,
but not as often.

00:06:25.800 --> 00:06:27.180
That explains it.

00:06:27.260 --> 00:06:30.850
The eye corners that are usually
painted red, are painted green instead.

00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:33.940
Shisui too.

00:06:34.940 --> 00:06:37.230
The group of Wang Mu
who came to the capital,

00:06:37.310 --> 00:06:40.780
and the white fox clan
that built a hidden village

00:06:40.860 --> 00:06:42.360
deep in the forest.

00:06:43.690 --> 00:06:46.240
Both came from the west

00:06:46.320 --> 00:06:48.410
and share the same roots.

00:06:55.040 --> 00:06:58.380
You can leave your mask here, Maomao.

00:06:59.130 --> 00:07:00.800
What do they do with them?

00:07:00.880 --> 00:07:03.050
They burn them after offering them
for a year, right?

00:07:04.300 --> 00:07:06.840
Come on, this way!

00:07:19.310 --> 00:07:21.020
They even have food stalls.

00:07:21.110 --> 00:07:23.650
Yeah. Want to grab something to eat?

00:07:23.730 --> 00:07:25.070
Only if you're treating.

00:07:25.650 --> 00:07:27.610
Then how about some skewers?

00:07:29.030 --> 00:07:31.870
Frog and grasshoppers, huh...

00:07:31.950 --> 00:07:35.290
Which one do you want, Maomao?
I'll have grasshoppers!

00:07:35.370 --> 00:07:38.000
They're plump and tasty this time of year!

00:07:39.460 --> 00:07:41.420
I'll have chicken.

00:07:41.500 --> 00:07:42.340
No frog?

00:07:43.000 --> 00:07:45.510
I'd rather not see one for a while.

00:07:49.590 --> 00:07:52.430
Have you never eaten bugs before?

00:07:52.510 --> 00:07:54.970
You don't really see them sold
in the pleasure district.

00:07:59.690 --> 00:08:01.060
I told you, that's gross.

00:08:01.690 --> 00:08:04.980
Oops, my bad! There was a locust mixed in.

00:08:05.070 --> 00:08:06.690
They all look the same to me.

00:08:06.780 --> 00:08:08.820
They're totally different!

00:08:09.740 --> 00:08:12.030
This one's delicious.

00:08:12.660 --> 00:08:14.200
I can't tell the difference, Shisui.

00:08:16.620 --> 00:08:19.080
Hey, look in the shrine!

00:08:20.420 --> 00:08:21.580
A child?

00:08:21.670 --> 00:08:26.210
That's Kyou-u. Every year, a child
takes on the role of the god like that.

00:08:26.300 --> 00:08:27.630
Oh, really.

00:08:27.720 --> 00:08:29.720
Now that I think about it,

00:08:29.800 --> 00:08:32.220
that brat did paint a pretty good mask.

00:08:33.350 --> 00:08:36.600
Still, it's impressive
how still he can sit.

00:08:36.680 --> 00:08:40.690
They take turns throughout the night.
Everyone wants a turn.

00:08:41.810 --> 00:08:44.070
It becomes a special memory.

00:08:44.860 --> 00:08:48.650
It should be time for a switch soon.
Let's go wait behind the shrine.

00:08:51.450 --> 00:08:54.580
Hey, look at this!

00:08:54.660 --> 00:08:56.370
What the heck is this?

00:08:56.450 --> 00:08:57.500
What's wrong?

00:08:57.580 --> 00:09:01.960
Ah. This rice stalk's all hollow.
It's the one the village chief gave us.

00:09:02.040 --> 00:09:06.000
His field's got a patch
where the rice grows really badly.

00:09:06.090 --> 00:09:09.670
He's stingy,
so he only gives us stuff from there.

00:09:09.760 --> 00:09:13.140
- Cheapskate!
- Just give up this year, yeah?

00:09:13.930 --> 00:09:15.600
This one's better, isn't it?

00:09:16.100 --> 00:09:17.680
Huh, really?

00:09:18.890 --> 00:09:20.850
Yay, thanks!

00:09:23.600 --> 00:09:25.520
Maomao, you're so kind.

00:09:25.610 --> 00:09:28.570
Not really. No point in me keeping it.

00:09:29.190 --> 00:09:30.030
Hey, sis!

00:09:31.530 --> 00:09:35.280
- How'd I do?
- You did great!

00:09:36.950 --> 00:09:39.870
I wish Mom could've seen it.

00:09:42.420 --> 00:09:45.500
He doesn't live with his mother?

00:09:46.340 --> 00:09:50.090
Let's go watch them burn
last year's masks.

00:10:03.270 --> 00:10:05.980
Hey, what did you write for your wish?

00:10:06.060 --> 00:10:07.270
Wish?

00:10:07.360 --> 00:10:09.730
"If your mask burns up completely
and ascends to the heavens,

00:10:09.820 --> 00:10:13.280
your wish will come true."
That's what they say.

00:10:13.360 --> 00:10:15.820
- Didn't you write one?
- I just found out.

00:10:15.910 --> 00:10:19.450
I figured you wouldn't believe
in that kind of superstition.

00:10:19.540 --> 00:10:23.410
It's not a superstition! It totally works.

00:10:23.500 --> 00:10:27.460
That's why last year I drew my mask
carefully and wrote my wish on it.

00:10:28.040 --> 00:10:31.210
- What did you write?
- Like I'd tell you!

00:10:31.300 --> 00:10:33.970
- Oh, right.
- Look, here they come.

00:10:43.230 --> 00:10:46.060
Kyou-u, didn't you want to
play that role too?

00:10:47.020 --> 00:10:50.940
I'm not a kid anymore.
I let the others have a go.

00:10:51.030 --> 00:10:54.030
- Such a grown-up.
- Putting on a brave face, huh.

00:11:26.100 --> 00:11:29.480
- Did you find your mask, Kyou-u?
- Not sure.

00:11:30.940 --> 00:11:33.030
I hope it burns up completely.

00:11:48.370 --> 00:11:51.000
Wishes that cannot come true
sink to the bottom...

00:11:51.590 --> 00:11:53.250
and become nourishment
for future blessings.

00:11:55.510 --> 00:11:57.760
Insects cannot survive the winter.

00:11:57.840 --> 00:12:00.430
They only leave behind their young...

00:12:10.650 --> 00:12:12.230
I'm home!

00:12:17.650 --> 00:12:20.490
You're back. Had dinner?

00:12:20.570 --> 00:12:21.780
I'll eat!

00:12:28.080 --> 00:12:29.370
How was the festival?

00:12:30.120 --> 00:12:34.250
Um, well... Just as we arrived,
Kyou-u was inside the shrine...

00:12:34.960 --> 00:12:36.050
What is it?

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:40.470
I thought it might be time for you
to fulfil your promise.

00:12:40.550 --> 00:12:42.970
You mean the medicine to revive the dead.

00:12:43.850 --> 00:12:46.720
Do you understand your position?

00:12:48.430 --> 00:12:50.520
Technically, I'm a hostage,

00:12:50.600 --> 00:12:53.730
but there are no restraints,
and they treat me well.

00:12:53.810 --> 00:12:57.690
Is it that they think I won't run?
Or is there another reason.

00:12:58.690 --> 00:13:01.530
Their behavior just doesn't sit right.

00:13:01.610 --> 00:13:04.120
Still, what matters now is...

00:13:05.200 --> 00:13:06.120
Fine.

00:13:06.200 --> 00:13:09.080
You used datura and pufferfish, right?
What ratio?

00:13:09.160 --> 00:13:12.710
What else did you use?
How much is the ideal dose?

00:13:12.790 --> 00:13:15.750
And what was the condition
of the revived person?

00:13:15.840 --> 00:13:18.590
How conscious were they?
Could they move right away?

00:13:20.010 --> 00:13:21.800
I do not think datura is necessary.

00:13:21.880 --> 00:13:22.720
Not necessary?

00:13:23.300 --> 00:13:25.680
It was in the foreign records,

00:13:25.760 --> 00:13:29.680
but it only prolongs unconsciousness.
Probably used to make people

00:13:29.770 --> 00:13:32.940
lose consciousness when enslaving them.

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:34.980
That was its original use.

00:13:36.070 --> 00:13:38.190
I got off lightly,

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:40.820
but if you fail, it causes memory loss.

00:13:40.900 --> 00:13:43.780
It still needs a lot of refinement
before being tested on humans.

00:13:44.370 --> 00:13:45.660
Feel free to use me.

00:13:45.740 --> 00:13:47.330
I will not test it on you.

00:13:47.410 --> 00:13:49.450
Why not! No need to hold back!

00:13:49.540 --> 00:13:50.700
You're a hostage.

00:13:52.330 --> 00:13:54.040
I'm glad you two get along.

00:13:54.880 --> 00:13:58.000
You don't have many friends,
do you? Either of you.

00:13:58.090 --> 00:14:00.300
- Shut up.
- Quiet.

00:14:04.340 --> 00:14:08.470
- You're close with Shisui, aren't you?
- Do I seem so?

00:14:09.310 --> 00:14:12.520
I wanted to ask Shisui more.

00:14:12.600 --> 00:14:14.850
Why she brought me here,

00:14:14.940 --> 00:14:17.480
what her goals are,

00:14:18.900 --> 00:14:22.110
who they are...?

00:14:30.330 --> 00:14:33.120
All of these... are medicinal herbs?

00:14:33.710 --> 00:14:35.880
Yes. I'm going out.

00:14:35.960 --> 00:14:39.250
There are guards outside,
so don't even think about running.

00:14:42.090 --> 00:14:44.550
I doubt she'll try.

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:47.890
Hey, what'd you do
to need guards watching you?

00:14:51.810 --> 00:14:54.690
Maomao, breakfast's getting cold.

00:14:54.770 --> 00:14:55.810
I'll eat later.

00:14:57.520 --> 00:15:00.150
Come on, don't say that!

00:15:00.230 --> 00:15:03.780
Here, get changed. I'll help.

00:15:03.860 --> 00:15:06.450
Whoa, lazy much?

00:15:06.530 --> 00:15:09.370
Acting all high and mighty,
like Lady Shenmei.

00:15:10.330 --> 00:15:11.450
Shenmei?

00:15:13.330 --> 00:15:14.830
There we go!

00:15:15.710 --> 00:15:19.040
Kyou-u, clear the dishes.

00:15:22.630 --> 00:15:25.010
He seems like a rich kid.

00:15:25.880 --> 00:15:27.300
Even rich kids can fall.

00:15:27.380 --> 00:15:30.720
No guarantee he'll stay one forever.

00:15:30.800 --> 00:15:32.260
I suppose so.

00:15:33.310 --> 00:15:36.060
Maomao, where's the hairpin
from yesterday?

00:15:36.140 --> 00:15:37.520
By the bed.

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:40.650
Geez, don't just leave it lying around.

00:15:42.190 --> 00:15:45.740
That's a nice one,
you shouldn't treat it so carelessly.

00:15:45.820 --> 00:15:47.320
Someone might steal it.

00:15:47.400 --> 00:15:49.070
Think it'd sell for a good price?

00:15:49.160 --> 00:15:50.990
It's not about price,

00:15:51.080 --> 00:15:54.870
it's the craftsmanship.
The patterns, the artisan's skill...

00:15:54.950 --> 00:15:59.290
Someone in the know
could probably tell who commissioned it.

00:15:59.380 --> 00:16:01.670
So I can't sell it then.

00:16:02.250 --> 00:16:06.170
The one who gave it to me is clingy,
will probably come after it.

00:16:06.670 --> 00:16:09.680
You'd have to melt it down for the metal.

00:16:09.760 --> 00:16:11.760
That'd be a waste.

00:16:13.470 --> 00:16:15.390
Feels like it's missing something.

00:16:19.980 --> 00:16:21.360
There, all done.

00:16:22.520 --> 00:16:24.190
You're good at this.

00:16:24.270 --> 00:16:27.320
Of course. If I was slow, I'd get hit.

00:16:27.900 --> 00:16:28.740
Hit?

00:16:29.320 --> 00:16:33.280
If I couldn't give a proper massage,
I'd get boiling water thrown on me.

00:16:33.370 --> 00:16:35.040
So I had to learn quickly.

00:16:35.120 --> 00:16:38.710
That's awful. What a terrible master.

00:16:39.370 --> 00:16:40.210
No.

00:16:40.920 --> 00:16:43.090
It was my mother.

00:16:46.090 --> 00:16:50.430
I don't want you to go through scary stuff
like that, Maomao. So behave, okay?

00:16:51.510 --> 00:16:53.350
I'm going out too today.

00:17:17.870 --> 00:17:19.870
Has it been about six hours?

00:17:24.540 --> 00:17:28.300
Incredible.
I can see all the way beyond the village.

00:17:31.430 --> 00:17:35.260
That field... it hasn't been harvested yet.

00:17:35.350 --> 00:17:37.390
Actually, it's still green?

00:17:37.890 --> 00:17:40.350
Is that a rice storage next to it?

00:17:41.140 --> 00:17:42.230
Come to think of it...

00:17:42.310 --> 00:17:46.150
His field's got a patch
where the rice grows really badly.

00:17:46.820 --> 00:17:50.570
So that's the spot with poor growth?

00:17:50.650 --> 00:17:52.650
And it's a perfect rectangle.

00:17:53.320 --> 00:17:54.200
Could it be...

00:17:54.280 --> 00:17:56.030
Hey!

00:17:58.080 --> 00:17:59.910
What are you doing here?

00:18:01.120 --> 00:18:05.500
Keep your voice down.

00:18:05.580 --> 00:18:07.920
- Where's my sister?
- No idea.

00:18:08.000 --> 00:18:09.090
Ow!

00:18:09.170 --> 00:18:11.970
Hey, do you know what that building is?

00:18:12.050 --> 00:18:15.930
Huh? Oh, that's
the old village chief's storehouse.

00:18:16.010 --> 00:18:20.430
They built a new one with raised floors
to keep rats out, so I don't think

00:18:20.520 --> 00:18:21.890
that one's used anymore.

00:18:24.810 --> 00:18:26.810
Can you get to it?

00:18:26.900 --> 00:18:29.360
You're being watched, aren't you?

00:18:30.190 --> 00:18:32.110
Well, it's not impossible.

00:18:32.190 --> 00:18:33.820
Really? How?

00:18:34.860 --> 00:18:37.870
Fine, I'll tell you.

00:18:37.950 --> 00:18:41.830
I use it to sneak out of my lessons,
after all!

00:18:42.540 --> 00:18:43.870
Total brat...

00:18:57.930 --> 00:18:59.050
What are we doing here?

00:18:59.140 --> 00:19:01.810
There's something I want to check.

00:19:02.390 --> 00:19:04.730
Maybe this patch
didn't get enough nutrients?

00:19:04.810 --> 00:19:07.310
- I don't think that's it.
- How do you know?

00:19:08.360 --> 00:19:13.030
This window's size matches the width
of the unripe rice exactly.

00:19:13.860 --> 00:19:17.070
That patch has been lit up at night

00:19:17.160 --> 00:19:18.780
by the light leaking from the window.

00:19:18.870 --> 00:19:22.160
Plants grow worse with more light?

00:19:22.240 --> 00:19:25.750
Usually, people say sunlight helps,

00:19:25.830 --> 00:19:30.170
but constant light, day and night,
can mess up their growth cycle.

00:19:31.710 --> 00:19:33.380
Just like how you can force plants

00:19:34.050 --> 00:19:37.470
to bloom off-season
by changing their environment.

00:19:39.010 --> 00:19:41.140
You said there are rats here, right?

00:19:41.220 --> 00:19:44.930
Yeah. Even with traps,
they never seem to go away.

00:19:45.020 --> 00:19:47.810
So, free specimens...

00:19:47.900 --> 00:19:51.570
Suirei said the drug
still needs refinement

00:19:51.650 --> 00:19:53.650
before it can be tested on humans.

00:19:54.740 --> 00:19:55.780
Makes sense.

00:19:55.860 --> 00:19:59.660
They're testing it on small animals first.

00:20:04.290 --> 00:20:05.870
What a shady kid.

00:20:07.710 --> 00:20:10.290
So what's inside?

00:20:10.380 --> 00:20:12.590
I've got a good idea.

00:20:22.260 --> 00:20:24.010
Ugh, rats.

00:20:24.100 --> 00:20:27.230
As I thought,
this is where they've been experimenting.

00:20:27.310 --> 00:20:30.730
Ugh, I want to take all of this.

00:20:30.810 --> 00:20:33.190
No, now's not the time.

00:20:33.270 --> 00:20:34.360
What's this?

00:20:36.190 --> 00:20:39.070
Metal tubes? There's loads of them.

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:44.330
Why are those here?

00:20:47.700 --> 00:20:49.460
I didn't expect this.

00:20:50.290 --> 00:20:52.330
This is bad.

00:20:54.210 --> 00:20:56.420
This looks just like
a workshop for "Feifa."

00:20:58.970 --> 00:21:03.800
Just like the assassins who attacked
Lord Jinshi during the hunt.

00:21:11.190 --> 00:21:12.440
Oh my?

00:21:12.520 --> 00:21:15.110
I wonder why the door was unlocked?

00:21:15.820 --> 00:21:18.110
Did someone forget to close it?

00:21:18.190 --> 00:21:21.950
- There's no way.
- But it was open.

00:21:22.030 --> 00:21:23.820
Who was in charge of locking up?

00:21:24.450 --> 00:21:26.950
Crap! It's Lady Shenmei...

00:21:27.620 --> 00:21:29.410
How strange.

00:21:30.830 --> 00:21:33.170
Is there a problem?

00:21:33.250 --> 00:21:35.880
That's... the envoy from that time.

00:21:35.960 --> 00:21:39.300
No, Lord Ayla. It was nothing.

00:21:39.920 --> 00:21:41.800
Just my imagination...

00:21:55.190 --> 00:21:57.520
Looks like two filthy rats

00:21:57.610 --> 00:22:00.900
have snuck in.

00:22:02.030 --> 00:22:03.360
Shen...

00:22:04.530 --> 00:22:06.070
Lady Shenmei.

00:22:07.910 --> 00:22:08.950
So this is her.

00:22:10.870 --> 00:22:11.870
Shenmei.

00:23:46.060 --> 00:24:00.950
NEXT EPISODE PREVIEW

00:23:58.160 --> 00:24:00.950
Next episode: Fortress

00:24:00.140 --> 00:24:00.930
